"plus sign (+)."
msgstr "Formatira trenutačni redak ili odabrane retke kao popis s grafičkim oznakama, koristeći znak plus (+)."

#: src/appactions.cpp:150
msgctxt "ghostwriter::AppActions|"
msgid "1. Numbered List"
msgstr "1. Numerirani popis"

#: src/appactions.cpp:150
msgctxt "ghostwriter::AppActions|"
msgid "CTRL+1"
msgstr "CTRL+1"

#: src/appactions.cpp:152 src/appactions.cpp:165
msgctxt "ghostwriter::AppActions|"
msgid "Formats the current line or selected lines as a numbered list."
msgstr "Formatira trenutačni redak ili odabrane retke kao numerirani popis."

#: src/appactions.cpp:155
msgctxt "ghostwriter::AppActions|"
msgid ""
"<p>Formats the current line or selected lines as a numbered "
"list.</p><p>Example:</p><p>1. item one<br/>2. item two<br/>3. item "
"three<br/></p>"
msgstr "<p>Formatira trenutačni redak ili odabrane retke kao numerirani popis.</p><p>Primjer:</p><p>1. prva stavka<br/>2. druga stavka<br/>3. treća stavka<br/></p>"

#: src/appactions.cpp:163
msgctxt "ghostwriter::AppActions|"
msgid "1) Numbered List"
msgstr "1) Numerirani popis"

#: src/appactions.cpp:163
msgctxt "ghostwriter::AppActions|"
msgid "CTRL+0"
msgstr "CTRL+0"

#: src/appactions.cpp:168
msgctxt "ghostwriter::AppActions|"
msgid ""
"<p>Formats the current line or selected lines as a numbered "
"list.</p><p>Example:</p><p>1) item one<br/>2) item two<br/>3) item "
"three<br/></p><p>Note that this numbering format is not supported by all "
"Markdown processors and is not part of CommonMark.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Formatira trenutačni redak ili odabrane retke kao numerirani popis.</p><p>Primjer:</p><p>1) prva stavka<br/>2) druga stavka<br/>3) treća stavka<br/></p><p>Imajte na umu da ovaj oblik numeriranja ne podržavaju svi procesori Markdowna i da nije dio standarda CommonMark.</p>"

#: src/appactions.cpp:178
msgctxt "ghostwriter::AppActions|"
msgid "Task List"
msgstr "Popis zadataka"

#: src/appactions.cpp:178
msgctxt "ghostwriter::AppActions|"
msgid "CTRL+T"
msgstr "CTRL+T"

#: src/appactions.cpp:179
msgctxt "ghostwriter::AppActions|"
msgid "Formats the current line or selected lines as a task list."
msgstr "Formatira trenutačni redak ili odabrane retke kao popis zadataka."

#: src/appactions.cpp:181
msgctxt "ghostwriter::AppActions|"
msgid ""
"<p>Formats the current line or selected lines as a task "
"list.</p><p>Example:</p><p>- [ ] item one<br/>- [ ] item two<br/>- [ ] item "
"three<br/></p><p>Note that task lists are not supported by all Markdown "
"processors and are not part of CommonMark.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Formatira trenutačni redak ili odabrane retke kao popis zadataka.</p><p>Primjer:</p><p>- [ ] prva stavka<br/>- [ ] druga stavka<br/>- [ ] treća stavka<br/></p><p>Imajte na umu da popise zadataka ne podržavaju svi procesori Markdowna i da nisu dio standarda CommonMark.</p>"

#: src/appactions.cpp:191
msgctxt "ghostwriter::AppActions|"
msgid "Toggle Task(s) Complete"
msgstr "Uključi/isključi dovršenost zadatka"

#: src/appactions.cpp:191
msgctxt "ghostwriter::AppActions|"
msgid "CTRL+D"
msgstr "CTRL+D"

#: src/appactions.cpp:193
msgctxt "ghostwriter::AppActions|"
msgid ""
"Toggle the current task item or selected task items as complete or "
"incomplete."
msgstr "Označava trenutačnu stavku zadatka ili odabrane stavke kao dovršene ili nedovršene, odnosno obrnuto."

#: src/appactions.cpp:196
msgctxt "ghostwriter::AppActions|"
msgid ""
"<p>Toggle the state of the current task item or selected task items from a "
"task list as complete or incomplete.</p><p>Applying this action to an "
"incomplete task item in a task list will result in placing an 'x' between "
"its brackets, like so:</p><p>- [x] item one<br/></p><p>Likewise, applying "
"this action to an completed task item in a task list will result in removing "
"its 'x' between its brackets, like so:</p><p>- [ ] item one<br/></p><p>Note "
"that task lists are not supported by all Markdown processors and are not "
"part of CommonMark.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Mijenja stanje trenutačne stavke zadatka ili odabranih stavki na popisu zadataka iz dovršenog u nedovršeno ili obrnuto.</p><p>Primjenom ove radnje na nedovršenu stavku zadatka između uglatih zagrada umeće se 'x', ovako:</p><p>- [x] prva stavka<br/></p><p>Isto tako, primjenom ove radnje na dovršenu stavku zadatka uklanja se 'x' između uglatih zagrada, ovako:</p><p>- [ ] prva stavka<br/></p><p>Imajte na umu da popise zadataka ne podržavaju svi procesori Markdowna i da nisu dio standarda CommonMark.</p>"

